  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">A MIDI controller for your drawing tablet</p>
    <h1>Strum your synth<br><em>with a pen.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Sketchatone lets you use a drawing tablet a bit like a guitar. Move your pen across virtual strings to play chords on your synth or in your DAW.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href="/playing/">Play Sketchatone <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
