<section class="manifesto section-wrap" id="the-instrument" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
  <h2 id="manifesto-title">Choose a chord.<br><em>Strum across the tablet.</em></h2>
  <p>Each time your pen crosses a virtual string, Sketchatone sends a MIDI note. Your synth or DAW makes the sound. Move slowly to pick out notes, or sweep across for a full strum.</p>
</section>

